    {href: "/internal-recording-vs-external-recorder-ninja-v", title: "Evaluating External HDMI Video Recorders and ProRes Workflows"}
  ]} />

  <CourseCTA text="Secure your wedding hardware today, then discover how to transform raw event footage into cinematic masterpieces inside DaVinci Resolve." />

</article>

</Layout>
